#20 37.27 usage: run.sh [options] <dataset name>
#20 37.27 
#20 37.27 ODX is a free and open source photogrammetry engine used to generate maps,
#20 37.27 point clouds, 3D models and DEMs from aerial and ground images.
#20 37.27 https://github.com/WebODM/ODX
#20 37.27 
#20 37.27 positional arguments:
#20 37.27   <dataset name>        Name of dataset (i.e subfolder name within project
#20 37.27                         folder). Default: code
#20 37.27 
#20 37.27 options:
