#20 37.27                         true unless you are positive you need it, and even
#20 37.27                         then: do not use it. Default: False
#20 37.27   --no-gpu              Do not use GPU acceleration, even if it's available.
#20 37.27                         Default: False
#20 37.27   --mesh-size <positive integer>
#20 37.27                         The maximum vertex count of the output mesh. Default:
#20 37.27                         200000
#20 37.27   --mesh-octree-depth <integer: 1 <= x <= 14>
#20 37.27                         Octree depth used in the mesh reconstruction, increase
