#20 37.27   --crop <positive float>
#20 37.27                         Automatically crop image outputs by creating a smooth
#20 37.27                         buffer around the dataset boundaries, shrunk by N
#20 37.27                         meters. Use 0 to disable cropping. Default: 3
#20 37.27   --boundary <json>     GeoJSON polygon limiting the area of the
